stopian art, particularly in the works of Salvador Dali."}, {"requirement": "smooth and vivid language", "plan": "Use descriptive language to describe the ways in which literature has influenced the development of art, such as the use of symbolism and metaphor in the works of Rene Magritte."}, {"requirement": "avoid superficial generalizations", "plan": "Avoid making broad statements about the relationship between literature and art, instead focusing on specific examples and case studies."}], "distinctive_material": "In-depth analysis of the intersection of art forms", "risk": "Overemphasis on superficial generalizations"}, "association_packet": {"mode": "none", "branch_id": "C", "items": [], "instruction": "No retrieval is used for this branch."}, "constraint_map": {"task_type": "Essay", "must_include": ["interdisciplinary dialogue between literature and art", "classic examples of cross-disciplinary cases", "specific and vivid analysis", "sensitive analysis", "smooth and vivid language", "avoid superficial generalizations"], "must_avoid": ["superficial generalizations", "lack of specific examples"], "form_or_structure": ["three cross-disciplinary cases", "begin with a classic literary quotation", "conclusion with philosophical reflections"], "style_or_tone": ["sensitive analysis", "vivid language", "emphasize tension and aesthetic harmony"], "open_questions_or_ambiguities": ["how to balance analysis and generalization", "how to effectively use cross-disciplinary cases to illustrate points"], "likely_failure_modes": ["overemphasis on superficial generalizations", "lack of concrete examples to support analysis"]}, "branch_expansion_summary": {"branch_count": 3, "all_branch_ids": ["A", "B", "C"]}, "status": "drafted", "candidate": {"branch_id": "C", "candidate_answer": "The Intersection of Art Forms: A Study of Interdisciplinary Dialogue\n\nIn the realm of art, there exists a profound intersection of literature and visual art, where the boundaries between the two form